  "job_B8.4.3.2_20251003_114848": {
    "chunk_text": "unres bearn. & Andream, & Philippum, & Bartholomeum & Thomam, & Iacobum Alphei, & Taddeum, & & Iudam scarioth, se hine sealde. & eft him to com swa micel menigu \u00fe\u00e6t hi n\u00e6fdon hlaf to etanne. & \u00fea hi hine gehyrdon hi ferdon \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine namon & \u00feus cw\u00e6don, So\u00f0lice he is on hatheortnesse & \u00fea boceras \u00fee wendon fram Hierusalem cw\u00e6don, So\u00felice he h\u00e6f\u00f0 Beelzebub & on deofla ealdre he & he hi tog\u00e6dere geclypode & on bigspellum him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Hu m\u00e6g Satanas Satanan ut adrifan? & gif his rice on him sylfum bi\u00f0 tod\u00e6led, hu m\u00e6g hit standan? & gif \u00fe\u00e6t hus ofer hit sylf ys tod\u00e6led, hu m\u00e6g hit standan? & gif satanas win\u00f0 ongen hine sylfne he bi\u00f0 tod\u00e6led & he standan ne m\u00e6g ac h\u00e6f\u00f0 ende. Ne m\u00e6g man \u00feone strangan his \u00e6hta & his fatu bereafian & on his hus gan, buton man \u00feone strangan So\u00f0lice ic eow secge \u00fe\u00e6t ealle synna synd manna bearnum forgyfene, & bysmorunga \u00feam \u00f0e hi So\u00felice ic eow secge, se \u00fee \u00f0one halgan gast bysmera\u00f0, se n\u00e6f\u00f0 on ecnysse forgyfenesse, ac bi\u00f0 eces For\u00feam \u00fee hi cw\u00e6don he h\u00e6f\u00f0 uncl\u00e6nne gast. \u00dea com to him his modor & his gebro\u00f0ra, & \u00fearute stodon & to him sendon, & to him clypedon. & mycel menigu ymb hine s\u00e6t and to him cw\u00e6don, her is \u00fein modor & \u00feine gebro\u00f0ra ute & seca\u00fe",
